<title>PHILIPPINES: Petrofields stockholders okay conversion.</title>
<headline>Petrofields stockholders okay conversion.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrofields Exploration and Development Co Inc said on Friday its stockholders had approved the change in the firm's primary purpose from oil exploration to an investment and management concern.</p>
<p>Corporate secretary Soledad Cagampang de Castro said in a statement shareholders also approved at their meeting on Wednesday the change in company's name to Petrofields Corporation.</p>
<p>The stockholders also approved an increase in the par value of Petrofields shares to one peso from one centavo each.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8936, fax 817-6267</p>
